# Frontend build inputs the viewer image regenerates for itself. A host `node_modules/`
# shipped in the build context is both large and wrong (native deps are built for the
# host, not the image), and pnpm refuses to clobber a foreign store without a TTY.
# docker/viewer.Dockerfile installs from the lockfile instead.
**/node_modules/
**/.svelte-kit/
packages/viewer/build/
packages/viewer/test-results/
